{"id":"w7ThoJFB","slug":"zoomify","title":"Zoomify (Zoom)","description":"A zoom mod with infinite customizability.","author":"isxander","categories":["fabric","neoforge","quilt","utility"],"display_categories":["fabric","neoforge","quilt","utility"],"client_side":"required","server_side":"unsupported","project_type":"mod","downloads":72523580,"followers":11103,"license":{"id":"LGPL-3.0-only","name":"GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 only"},"loaders":["fabric","neoforge","quilt"],"game_versions":["1.18","1.18.1","1.18.2","1.19","1.19.1","1.19.2","1.19.3","1.19.4","1.20","1.20.1","1.20.2","1.20.3","1.20.4","1.20.5","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.9","1.21.10","1.21.11","26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.2","26.3","26.4-snapshot-1"],"latest_version":"gwKcDOSy","date_created":"2022-01-29T20:52:18.744493Z","date_modified":"2026-10-08T12:59:28.951534Z","updated":"2026-10-08T12:59:28.951534Z","color":4811407,"body":"<div align=\"center\"><center>\n\n![logo](/launcher-preview/bodies/w7ThoJFB/0.webp)\n\n# Zoomify\n\n[Mod Loader](https://fabricmc.net)\nEnviroment\n[Discord](https://short.isxander.dev/discord)\n\n[Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/zoomify)\n[CurseForge](https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zoomify)\n\n[Ko-fi](https://ko-fi.com/isxander)\n\n*A zoom mod with infinite customizability.*\n\nZoomify aims to provide the easiest, most configurable and most sexy looking zoom mod you will ever find.\n\nZoom Example\n\n[![](/launcher-preview/bodies/w7ThoJFB/1.webp)](https://bisecthosting.com/xander)\n\n</center></div>\n\n## How to use\n### Keybind\nInitially, Minecraft has a keybind that overrides Zoomify by default.\nGo to the controls menu and make sure the Zoomify keybind (default `C`)\nisn't conflicting (goes red).\n\n### Open settings menu\nYou can access the settings menu with two ways.\n\n- The client command `/zoomify`\n- [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) settings button\n\n## Features\n### Scroll Zoom\nYou can zoom in further using your scroll wheel.\n\nScroll Zoom Example\n\n### Spyglass Integration\nYou can configure Zoomify to only be able to zoom in when you are holding or carrying a spyglass.\nOr even just override the spyglass zoom with Zoomify!\n\nShow the spyglass overlay and play spyglass sound effects when using Zoomify.\n\nSpyglass Integration Example\n\n### Transitions\n**14 different** transitions to choose from!\n\n- Instant\n- Linear\n- [Ease in Sine](https://easings.net/#easeInSine)\n- [Ease out Sine](https://easings.net/#easeOutSine)\n- [Ease in/out Sine](https://easings.net/#easeInOutSine)\n- [Ease in Quad](https://easings.net/#easeInQuad)\n- [Ease out Quad](https://easings.net/#easeOutQuad)\n- [Ease in/out Quad](https://easings.net/#easeInOutQuad)\n- [Ease in Cubic](https://easings.net/#easeInCubic)\n- [Ease out Cubic](https://easings.net/#easeOutCubic)\n- [Ease in/out Cubic](https://easings.net/#easeInOutCubic)\n- [Ease in Exponential](https://easings.net/#easeInExp)\n- [Ease out Exponential](https://easings.net/#easeOutExp)\n- [Ease in/out Exponential](https://easings.net/#easeInOutExp)\n\nYou can even pick what transition you would like for zooming in and out individually!\n\nIndividual Transition Config\n\n### Relative Sensitivity\nReduce your mouse sensitivity based on the amount of zoom,\nso you have fine control over your player.\n\nRelative Sensitivity Example\n\n### Relative View Bobbing\nReduce the view bobbing effect based on the amount of zoom,\nso you can walk and zoom at the same time!\n\nRelative View Bobbing Example\n\n### Cinematic Camera\nMake the mouse/camera smooth, like the zoom in [OptiFine](https://www.optifine.net).\n\nCinematic Cam Example\n\n### Affect Hand FOV\nTurn off this setting to prevent your hand from also being zoomed in!\n\nAffect Hand FOV Turned Off Example\n\n### Secondary Zoom\n\nCompletely separate zoom from normal Zoomify.\nAimed for content creators, features `Hide HUD While Zooming` option and longer zoom in times.\n\nSecondary Zoom Example\n\n### Presets\n\nYou can reset to default, make Zoomify behave like OptiFine and others!\n\n### Smart Keybinding Detection\n\nOn first launch, if a keybinding is conflicting with Zoomify's zoom, a notification will appear notifying them of this.\n\nKeybinding Conflict Detection\n\n### Highly configurable\nAbsolutely **NO** hard-coded values. Everything about your zoom is configurable!\n\n### Control the zoom speed with seconds\nInstead of some stupid arbitrary value such as zoom speed, you can pick\nthe exact amount of seconds it will take to zoom in, with a separate setting for zooming out.\n\n### Credits\n- [Xander](https://github.com/isXander) - Developer\n- [MoonTidez](https://github.com/MoonTidez) - Logo designer\n\n#### Translators\nLanguages in alphabetical order\n\n- [神枪968](https://github.com/GodGun968) - 简体中文 / Chinese (Simplified)\n- [Xander](https://github.com/isXander) - English (United Kingdom)\n- [Madis0](https://github.com/Madis0) - eesti keel / Estonian\n- [co-91](https://github.com/co-91) - 日本語 / Japanese\n- [Rodrigo Appelt](https://github.com/Agentew04) - Português / Portuguese\n- [SyberiaK](https://github.com/SyberiaK) - Русский / Russian\n- [Felix14-v2](https://github.com/Felix14-v2) - Русский / Russian\n- [Zetsphiron](https://github.com/Zetsphiron) - Español (mexicano) / Spanish (Mexico)\n- [Zetsphiron](https://github.com/Zetsphiron) - Español (españa) / Spanish (Spain)\n- [localfossa](https://github.com/localfossa) - Türkçe / Turkish\n- [Im Vietnam](https://github.com/ImVietnam) - Tiếng Việt / Vietnamese\n","published":"2022-01-29T20:52:18.744493Z","additional_categories":[],"issues_url":"https://github.com/isXander/Zoomify/issues","source_url":"https://github.com/isXander/Zoomify","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://short.isxander.dev/discord","donation_urls":[{"platform":"Patreon","url":"https://patreon.com/isxander"}],"team":[{"username":"isxander","role":"Owner","avatar":"/launcher-preview/avatars/isxander.webp"}],"versions_total":108,"gallery":[{"url":"/launcher-preview/galleries/w7ThoJFB/0.webp","featured":true,"title":"Zoom Example","description":null,"created":"2023-11-23T00:02:56.383854Z"}],"versions":[{"id":"D64cvU6G","name":"Zoomify 2.17.0+mc26.2","version_number":"2.17.0+mc26.2","version_type":"release","game_versions":["26.2"],"loaders":["fabric","neoforge"],"featured":false,"date_published":"2026-10-08T12:59:28.951534Z","downloads":460648,"changelog":"# Zoomify 2.17.0\n\n## Changes\n\n- Support NeoForge\n- Allow scrolling out past the initial zoom (#308 -- thank you Saadndm)","dependencies":[{"project_id":"1eAoo2KR","version_id":null,"dependency_type":"required","file_name":null},{"project_id":"Ha28R6CL","version_id":null,"dependency_type":"required","file_name":null},{"project_id":"mOgUt4GM","version_id":null,"dependency_type":"optional","file_name":null},{"project_id":"1vrSzlao","version_id":null,"dependency_type":"required","file_name":null},{"project_id":"P7dR8mSH","version_id":null,"dependency_type":"required","file_name":null}],"files":[{"filename":"zoomify-2.17.0+mc26.2-universal.jar","size":579144,"primary":true}]},{"id":"gwKcDOSy","name":"Zoomify 2.17.0+mc26.1.2","version_number":"2.17.0+mc26.1.2","version_type":"release","game_versions":["26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2"],"loaders":["fabric","neoforge"],"featured":false,"date_published":"2026-10-08T12:59:28.950249Z","downloads":108630,"changelog":"# Zoomify 2.17.0\n\n## Changes\n\n- Support NeoForge\n- Allow scrolling out past the initial zoom (#308 -- thank you Saadndm)","dependencies":[{"project_id":"1vrSzlao","version_id":null,"dependency_type":"required","file_name":null},{"project_id":"P7dR8mSH","version_id":null,"dependency_type":"required","file_name":null},{"project_id":"1eAoo2KR","version_id":null,"dependency_type":"required","file_name":null},{"project_id":"Ha28R6CL","version_id":null,"dependency_type":"required","file_name":null},{"project_id":"mOgUt4GM","version_id":n